0003D8r 1  29 01                and #$01
0003DAr 1  85 11                sta LATBUF+1
0003DCr 1  AD 10 42             lda $4210               ; read RDNMI to clear its vblank flag; if the
0003DFr 1  C2 30                rep #$30                ; flag is set again by latch_end, the window
